OL,3,GNEWSAApp for blind bus users expands to
OL,4,A13 hospitals
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlind and partially sighted people will
OL,7,Fbe able to travel independently to 13
OL,8,Fhospitals in Surrey under an expanded
OL,9,Fcouncil scheme.
OL,11,FSurrey County Council (SCC) has been
OL,12,Fpiloting the Aira app, which allows
OL,13,Fpeople to call a trained visual
OL,14,Finterpreter who can guide them between
OL,15,Fthe bus stop and nearby railway
OL,16,Fstations.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
