OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAApp for blind bus users expands to
OL,4,A13 hospitals
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter expanding the pilot to eight
OL,7,Fareas including Caterham, Dorking and
OL,8,FOxted, SCC said the service would now
OL,9,Fbe available at hospitals including
OL,10,FRoyal Surrey County Hospital, Frimley
OL,11,FPark Hospital and Farnham Hospital.
OL,13,FMatt Furniss, cabinet member highways,
OL,14,Ftransport and economic growth, said SCC
OL,15,Fhopes this expansion will "support
OL,16,Fpeople to travel confidently and
OL,17,Findependently".
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
